From ae6f2bd6fe4be04b28c6e4ada8370b435e15eb0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 01:33:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] script: add a BIP340 Schnorr batch verification API

Add BatchSigCollector and secp256k1 Strauss/Pippenger batch Schnorr
signature verification.

Original-Commit: c2bb4dab8275459e352ba316363bcbd5a61f7deb
Original-Patch: ecash/019
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.

Candidate-Repair: This boundary adds the BIP340 batch MSM API only; the legacy
BatchSigCollector and script pipeline belong to owner27. Add an independent
native comparison with individual verification over empty/single/2/8/32/64
signature batches and altered signatures/messages, malformed R and null items.
No eCash signature or consensus rule is changed.
